 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "El imperativo",
    "@en": "The imperative"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para dar órdenes o instrucciones, usa la forma del presente sin pronombre. Con **tu** quitas la **-s** de los verbos en **-er**: **Tu écoutes** → **Écoute !** (¡escucha!).",
     "@en": "To give orders or instructions, use the form of the present without pronoun. With **tu** you remove the **-s** from the verbs in **-er**: **Tu écoutes** → **Écoute !** (listen!)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Con **vous** y **nous** no se quita nada: **Parlez !** (¡hablen!), **Mangeons !** (¡comamos!).",
     "@en": "With **vous** and **nous** nothing is taken away: **Parlez !** (speak!), **Mangeons !** (eat!)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Verbos muy usados",
    "@en": "Very used verbs"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Va** (ve), **allez** (id), **allons** (vamos).",
     "@en": "**Va** (ve), **allez** (id), **allons** (come on)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Sois** (sé), **soyez** (sed).",
     "@en": "**Sois** (know), **soyez** (thirst)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Aie** (ten), **ayez** (tened).",
     "@en": "**Aie** (ten), **ayez** (ten)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Negativo",
    "@en": "Negative"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Se pone **ne** y **pas** alrededor del verbo: **Ne parle pas !** (¡no hables!), **Ne mangez pas !** (¡no comáis!).",
     "@en": "**ne** and **pas** are put around the verb: **Ne parle pas !** (do not speak!), **Ne mangez pas !** (do not eat!)."
    }
   ]
  },
